[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_02_0010","text":"哈啊……哈啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_02_0020","text":"辛苦了\n我带了慰问品来，要不要休息一下"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_02_0030","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_02_0040","text":"休息的……余裕……没有……什么的……\n看……看不出来吗…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_02_0050","text":"……当偶像需要的，不只是技术吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_02_0060","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_02_0070","text":"啊哈哈……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_02_0080","text":"连技术都……没有的……人……\n该怎么办……才好呢…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_02_0090","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_02_0100","text":"不得鸟……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
